ModuleEInvoicingName = E-facturering
ModuleEInvoicingDesc = Support for E-invoice management. This module allows generating (automatically or manually) invoices in E-invoice format and sending them to an E-invoice Access Point. It can also retrieve purchase invoices from this E-invoice Access Point. Only a few countries (France) and Access Points (also called PDP/PA) are supported.

